WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.151
Ben floated toward the new wall.

2
00:00:04.152 --> 00:00:07.276
Cautiously, he poked his head through.

3
00:00:07.277 --> 00:00:19.069
On the other side, he saw two construction workers and a bag—filled with the stolen Egyptian jewels!

4
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:20.930
"Boo!" Ben shouted.

5
00:00:20.931 --> 00:00:26.080
The startled thieves jumped. "The ghost!" one cried.

6
00:00:26.081 --> 00:00:30.615
Both sprang to their feet and rushed out of a hidden door in the wall.

7
00:00:30.616 --> 00:00:33.845
"Stop, thieves!" Ben called after them.

8
00:00:33.846 --> 00:00:37.818
He floated after the workers as fast as he could.

9
00:00:37.819 --> 00:00:42.789
Crash! Just then Gaby burst through the construction area.

10
00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:49.717
The thieves were running for the front door, but Gaby tossed a big dinosaur bone in their path.

11
00:00:49.718 --> 00:00:53.878
"Ahh!" The workers screamed and turned around.

12
00:00:53.879 --> 00:00:57.684
They ran toward the Egyptian exhibit.

13
00:00:57.685 --> 00:01:02.732
Winnie swooped after them on her broom. "I'll get them!"

14
00:01:02.733 --> 00:01:07.978
"I'll try a halting spell!" Waldo waved his wand.

15
00:01:07.979 --> 00:01:12.133
"Duck!" one thief cried as the spell sailed toward him.

16
00:01:12.134 --> 00:01:15.195
The two thieves dove to the floor.

17
00:01:15.196 --> 00:01:20.353
Winnie steered downward, zooming faster than Ben had ever seen her fly.

18
00:01:20.354 --> 00:01:24.813
Crash! Her broom smashed into Uncle Tut's display case.

19
00:01:24.814 --> 00:01:27.538
Shattered glass flew everywhere.

20
00:01:27.539 --> 00:01:30.093
Waldo was waving his wand again.

21
00:01:30.094 --> 00:01:38.517
This time a spell zapped Uncle Tut, still sleeping inside the case. Sha-zam!

22
00:01:38.518 --> 00:01:43.113
The ancient mummy's body shook all over.

23
00:01:43.114 --> 00:01:53.438
His eyes sprang open, and he let out an angry growl.

24
00:01:53.439 --> 00:01:58.091
"Who dares to disturb my rest?" he snarled.

25
00:01:58.092 --> 00:02:02.129
The two thieves were on the floor near the shattered display case.

26
00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:07.666
"Help!" they screamed as the old mummy walked over and grabbed them.

27
00:02:07.667 --> 00:02:13.054
Uncle Tut lifted both thieves at once and shook them hard.

28
00:02:13.055 --> 00:02:17.067
"Do not disturb the king!" he commanded.

29
00:02:17.068 --> 00:02:20.314
"We surrender!" the thieves cried.

30
00:02:20.315 --> 00:02:24.286
"We confess to everything."

31
00:02:24.287 --> 00:02:27.579
From inside her wrapping, Cleo was beaming.

32
00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:32.134
"Wow, Uncle Tut!" she said. "It's great to meet you!"

33
00:02:32.135 --> 00:02:35.947
The two museum guards suddenly raced into the room.

34
00:02:35.948 --> 00:02:40.060
Mr. Freaky was right behind them, looking very upset.

35
00:02:40.061 --> 00:02:44.552
"What in the world is going on here?" the principal cried.

36
00:02:44.553 --> 00:02:47.771
Ben grinned and pointed to Uncle Tut.

37
00:02:47.772 --> 00:02:50.653
The mummy was still clutching the thieves.

38
00:02:50.654 --> 00:02:53.979
"Uh, guess what, Mr. Freaky?" Ben said.

39
00:02:53.980 --> 00:03:02.359
"It looks like the mummy just wrapped up this case!"

40
00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:08.534
*** After the police took the thieves away, Mr. Freaky sank down on a bench in the

41
00:03:08.535 --> 00:03:15.741
lobby. "Everything is finally under

42
00:03:15.742 --> 00:03:22.223
control." "The construction workers were mad because I wouldn't pay them more," Dr. Bones said.

43
00:03:22.224 --> 00:03:27.260
"That's why they decided to steal the jewelry from the museum."

44
00:03:27.261 --> 00:03:31.691
"They knew we were coming here on a field trip," said Ben.

45
00:03:31.692 --> 00:03:34.850
"So they disguised themselves as zombies.

46
00:03:34.851 --> 00:03:38.003
That way, monsters would get blamed for the theft.

47
00:03:38.004 --> 00:03:40.949
Their plan almost worked!"

48
00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.654
Dr. Bones looked grateful.

49
00:03:43.655 --> 00:03:48.387
"Thank you, monsters, for helping to catch the thieves.

50
00:03:48.388 --> 00:03:56.319
The jewels are very valuable to the museum, and I owe all of you an apology."

51
00:03:56.320 --> 00:04:00.265
"Me too," Al Normal said sheepishly.

52
00:04:00.266 --> 00:04:02.679
He looked at Winnie.

53
00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:07.669
"You were right, young lady. Monsters are just like people."

54
00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:11.887
"I hope not!" Miss Bungle burst out.

55
00:04:11.888 --> 00:04:18.942
Everybody laughed.

56
00:04:18.943 --> 00:04:24.255
Dr. Bones turned to the ancient mummy, who had an arm around his niece.

57
00:04:24.256 --> 00:04:31.376
"I also want to apologize to you, Mr. Tut—er, Your Majesty.

58
00:04:31.377 --> 00:04:37.822
We would not have put you in that display if we'd known you were a live monster."

59
00:04:37.823 --> 00:04:41.071
"That's okay," Uncle Tut said.

60
00:04:41.072 --> 00:04:46.154
"Ruling an ancient kingdom is exhausting—I needed a rest.

61
00:04:46.155 --> 00:04:51.592
But now I have a lot of catching up to do. What century is this?"

62
00:04:51.593 --> 00:04:57.915
Cleo gave him a quick hug. "Wait till you meet my brothers and sisters, Uncle Tut!"

63
00:04:57.916 --> 00:05:02.111
"I'm sorry I was jealous of Cleo," Gaby whispered to Waldo.

64
00:05:02.112 --> 00:05:05.252
"I thought the two of you were sneaking out together last night.

65
00:05:05.253 --> 00:05:06.974
I should have trusted you."

66
00:05:06.975 --> 00:05:11.849
Waldo smiled at her. "It's a good thing you did get suspicious.

67
00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:14.040
You helped to stop the thieves."

68
00:05:14.041 --> 00:05:16.616
Dr. Bones was talking on her phone.

69
00:05:16.617 --> 00:05:20.034
A second later she clicked it off.

70
00:05:20.035 --> 00:05:24.573
"I just spoke with Mayor Hubbletree.

71
00:05:24.574 --> 00:05:30.521
We've agreed that this field trip was a huge success.

72
00:05:30.522 --> 00:05:34.198
Oh, and I have more good news."

73
00:05:34.199 --> 00:05:37.086
She flashed a smile at the monsters.

74
00:05:37.087 --> 00:05:47.287
"I believe I've convinced the mayor to send students from People Place to Monsterville for an overnight adventure!"

75
00:05:47.288 --> 00:05:52.297
All the monster kids cheered.

76
00:05:52.298 --> 00:05:58.343
The skeletons started rattling their bones and chanting, "Field trip! Field trip!"

77
00:05:58.344 --> 00:06:01.234
Mr. Freaky buried his face in his hands.

78
00:06:01.235 --> 00:06:06.681
"When will these field trips end?" he moaned.

79
00:06:06.682 --> 00:06:09.847
Winnie and Ben laughed.

80
00:06:09.848 --> 00:06:14.192
"Poor Mr. Freaky," Winnie said sympathetically.

81
00:06:14.193 --> 00:06:22.052
Ben nodded. A minute later he grabbed Winnie's hand.

82
00:06:22.053 --> 00:06:29.586
Together they ran outside, where the school bus was waiting to take everyone back to Monster Academy.

83
00:06:29.587 --> 00:06:33.303
"The field trip to People Place was fun," Ben thought.

84
00:06:33.304 --> 00:06:41.138
"But there's no place like Monsterville!"

